{"text": "The graph above shows the percentages of Canadians preferred reading formats by age group, based on a survey conducted in 2025. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In all age groups, Print Books were the most preferred reading format, with the 55 64 age group showing the highest preference at 71%. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The percentage of people who preferred Ebooks was the highest in the 18 29 age group, followed by the 30 44 age group. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> While the preference for Ebooks was higher than that for Audiobooks in the 18 29 age group, the opposite was true in both the 30 44 and 45 54 age groups. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The percentage of people who answered No Preference was highest in the 30 44 age group at 11%, which was more than twice that of the 45 54 age group. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the 55 64 age group, the percentage of people who preferred Audiobooks and the percentage of people who showed No Preference were both lower than that for Ebooks.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "g", "r", "a", "p", "h", " ", "a", "b", "o", "v", "e", " ", "s", "h", "o", "w", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "e", "r", "c", "e", "n", "t", "a", "g", "e", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "C", "a", "n", "a", "d", "i", "a", "n", "s", " ", "p", "r", "e", "f", "e", "r", "r", "e", "d", " ", "r", "e", "a", "d", "i", "n", "g", " ", "f", "o", "r", "m", "a", "t", "s", " ", "b", "y", " ", "a", "g", "e", " ", "g", "r", "o", "u", "p", ",", " ", "b", "a", "s", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "a", " ", "s", "u", "r", "v", "e", "y", " ", "c", "o", "n", "d", "u", "c", "t", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "2", "0", "2", "5", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "a", "g", "e", " ", "g", "r", "o", "u", "p", "s", ",", " ", "P", "r", "i", "n", "t", " ", "B", "o", "o", "k", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "s", "t", " ", "p", "r", 